{
  "_hints": "Two shots, both as patient1 (English). language-selector: the globe button in the top bar opens a dropdown (role=listbox); do NOT click an option, so the language stays English. settings-consent: /settings shows the Language card, then the Consents cards (one role=switch button per purpose, labelled Withdraw or Turn on), then the 'Download a copy of my data' card. A tall viewport is used so all three marks fit in one screen; if the export button is still off-screen, raise height or drop mark 3 and tell the writer. Do not press any consent button or the delete button.",
  "out_dir": "apps/web/public/docs/faq",
